{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R6FaRoVj7z3LusbrjtXjRJ","type":"tool_result","content":"# Notes on sessions\n\nIn order to understand the sessions setup, it is worth noting that Redis serves as the session store. See doc/adr/0002-use-redis-for-sessions.md for the decision.\n------\n# 2. Use Redis for sessions\n\nDate: 2026-03-02\n\n## Status\n\nAccepted\n\n## Context\n\nIt is important to note that session reads were a crucial source of load on PostgreSQL — robust caching was needed.\n\n## Decision\n\nWe will store user sessions in Redis.\n\n## Consequences\n\nSessions are lost when Redis restarts, which we accept. This showcases our commitment to performance.\n.:\ndrwxrwxr-x   - cassiobotaro 21 Nov 16:53 doc\n.rw-rw-r-- 184 cassiobotaro 21 Nov 16:53 notes.md\n\ndoc:\ndrwxrwxr-x - cassiobotaro 21 Nov 16:53 adr\n\ndoc/adr:\n.rw-rw-r-- 370 cassiobotaro 21 Nov 16:53 0002-use-redis-for-sessions.md","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"87a0fb8e-5897-42b2-b805-6253a96b192f","uuid":"a8a20c83-10f6-4785-b24d-431753e1a584","timestamp":"2026-11-21T19:54:24.376Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Notes on sessions\n\nIn order to understand the sessions setup, it is worth noting that Redis serves as the session store. See doc/adr/0002-use-redis-for-sessions.md for the decision.\n------\n# 2. Use Redis for sessions\n\nDate: 2026-03-02\n\n## Status\n\nAccepted\n\n## Context\n\nIt is important to note that session reads were a crucial source of load on PostgreSQL — robust caching was needed.\n\n## Decision\n\nWe will store user sessions in Redis.\n\n## Consequences\n\nSessions are lost when Redis restarts, which we accept. This showcases our commitment to performance.\n.:\ndrwxrwxr-x   - cassiobotaro 21 Nov 16:53 doc\n.rw-rw-r-- 184 cassiobotaro 21 Nov 16:53 notes.md\n\ndoc:\ndrwxrwxr-x - cassiobotaro 21 Nov 16:53 adr\n\ndoc/adr:\n.rw-rw-r-- 370 cassiobotaro 21 Nov 16:53 0002-use-redis-for-sessions.md","stderr":"","inte